      "en": "Violaine's sacrifice silently fertilizes the soil of Combernon and restores the spiritual order: the miraculous resurrection of the child of aubevoye in the heart of christmas night bears witness to the infinite fruitfulness of sanctity buried in silence and total renunciation."
