      "en": "Rodrigo's final fall into absolute poverty is the true apotheosis of his recovered sanctity: at the end of his life, stripped of all his glories as viceroy of the indies, chained on a boat as a refuse of humanity, rodrigo is taken in by poor nuns and finds supreme deliverance in absolute humility."
