      "en": "It is in this certainty of eternal communion that our pilgrimage in the land of sacred poetry draws to a close: at the end of his life, stripped of all his glories as viceroy of the indies, chained on a boat as a refuse of humanity, rodrigo is taken in by poor nuns and finds supreme deliverance in absolute humility."
